{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n \n 私、猫舌じゃなくなりました。\n 猫舌の対義語はなんだろう。\n \n 象舌？ライオン舌？\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n ハッスルプレスさんで番外編が公開されました、！！\n \n \n オフショットです☺︎\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XWDFS70XZA1PY1P6W6TTV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XWEGP3Q8KNPGBWYD7N26A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XWFG48FW1GGW2W16VV6VS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n 普段とは全く違う雰囲気で撮っていただいて、\n 本当に嬉しいです！自分じゃないみたいです、！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XWGFJ95Q933WH19CRP55X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 因みに前回の髪の毛ストレートo(^-^)o\n \n \n どちらの髪型も私はお気に入りです～\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XWHGJZDB8SMHXK1FZKR3Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XWJHCZR3DHEJQMQ5SWBRZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n こんな自撮りもしてました☺︎（笑）\n \n \n 沢山撮ったからまた載せちゃいます〜！\n \n \n \n 私の写真ばっかりでごめんなさい、\n \n \n \n \n 最近、寒くなったり暖かくなったり\n すごーく気温の変化が激しいので\n 体調には気をつけてくださいね。\n \n \n \n \n ではまたね(　˙-˙　)/\n \n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}